surgery, a last resort. But some so-called primitive animals are about to help us. If

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:50.330
only we could learn a little more about their amazing hearts. The arteries that nourish

00:26:50.330 --> 00:26:57.360
our hearts can become critically blocked. Only a bypass can save us. Scientists are now probing

