00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:10.780
normal service to the lungs and muscles. These animals are superbly adapted for swimming.

00:29:13.580 --> 00:29:20.660
Forward thrust provided by the powerful tail, legs streamlined to the body,

00:29:23.460 --> 00:29:27.140
buoyancy and posture adjusted via air supply to the lungs.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:46.000
grace and economy, there can be few better swimmers. Tales of early European explorers.

